  "title": "Mom's Giblet Gravy",
  "description": "This neck and giblet gravy with white wine, celery leaves, and onion needs about 2 hours to simmer, making it the perfect thing to start while the turkey's cooking.",
  "authors": [
    "Tikeren"
  ],
